[342.966, "\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe kernel\u001b[14Gis partly FMA-latency-bound: a singl\u001b[51G stream with 4 accumulators\u001b[79Gtops out n\u001b[90Gar 51 GB/s, while interleaved\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Brows reach about 62 GB/s on the\u001b[35G768-column shapes. The 2048-column\u001b[70Gw2\u001b[73Gshape\u001b[79Gstays\u001b[85Gslower\u001b[92Gat\u001b[95Gabout\u001b[101G47\u001b[104GGB/s,\u001b[110Gso\u001b[113GI'm\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btesting\u001b[11Gmore\u001b[16Gaccumulators\u001b[29Gand\u001b[33Ga\u001b[35Gdifferent\u001b[45Gloop\u001b[50Gorder\u001b[56Gfor\u001b[60Git\u001b[63Gnext.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mTh\u001b[6G packed single-stream layout hits about 62 GB/s,\u001b[55Gagainst\u001b[63Groughly\u001b[71G50\u001b[74GGB/s\u001b[79Gfor\u001b[83Gthe\u001b[87Gcurrent\u001b[95Gkernel,\u001b[103Gso\u001b[106GI'm\u001b[110Grepacking\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bevery\u001b[9Gmatmul\u001b[16Gweight\u001b[23Gin\u001b[26Gforward-pass\u001b[39Gorder\u001b[45Gat\u001b[48Gload.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m\u23fa\u001b[3G\u001b[39mPacked layout brings\u001b[24Ga forward pass to\u001b[42G7.96 ms, with every\u001b[62Gmat"]
